        "coreProblem": "Product managers lack a unified, structured tool for thinking, planning, writing, and tracking work. Notes sprawl across unstructured text files and fragmented apps, making it impossible to organize, find, or act on information. Action items from meetings get lost, notes pile up with no structure, and opening a file dumps all notes at once with no way to navigate.",
